Modifications made in this project:
  * the glyph is placed on a white circular badge and recoloured to #1a1a1a;
  * the badge is rasterised at nine sizes (16, 20, 24, 32, 40, 48, 64, 128,
    256 px) and packed into icons/power.ico as 32 bpp DIB entries;
  * the resulting file is installed as power.ico next to PowerButton.exe.

During icon selection this project also rendered candidate glyphs from Fluent
UI System Icons, Lucide (ISC), Tabler, Phosphor, Bootstrap Icons, Heroicons,
Carbon and Ionicons (MIT or Apache-2.0) for comparison. Those renders are not
part of the distributed source tree or binaries; only the Material Symbols
glyph above is shipped.
